DVBlast Unicable

GPL-2.0-only. See LICENSE.

The helper and scanner were originally developed in the tools/unicable directory
of smdbg's headend project. This standalone distribution retains the tuning and
scanning C source behavior. unicable-tune is the generic executable name;
lock-adapter7 is provided as a compatibility symlink.

The EN50494 frequency calculation follows the approach in VDR's
cDiseqc::SetScrFrequency(), with reference implementation by Klaus Schmidinger
and the VDR contributors:
https://github.com/vdr-projects/vdr/blob/master/diseqc.c

DVBlast is a separate VideoLAN project. It is not bundled or linked into these
tools, and this project is not an official DVBlast release.
https://www.videolan.org/projects/dvblast.html

The Linux DVB userspace API and TBS STiD135 driver source were used as references.
Primary links are in docs/DETAILS.md. No private configuration, credentials,
channel recordings, DVB driver or firmware files are included.
